# Pairs with ReadableOnceComplete. #4545's second fix (#4644) without the
# witness carriage: a leaf split hands the moved key to a fresh sibling without
# the donor's durable witness that the saga's terminal settled it, so an
# unstamped marker reaching the sibling later is installed and gates the key
# after the saga completed.
MODULE: ReadableOnceCompleteWitnessNotCarried
TARGET: ReadableOnceComplete
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: a leaf split drops the witness, so an unstamped marker on the sibling gates the key after the saga completed
PERTURBS: LeafSplit

--- FIND
    /\ lk /\ ~term[c][s] /\ ~wit
    /\ row[c][s][k] < SagaV
--- REPLACE
\* MUTATION: the marker carries no prepare stamp.
    /\ lk /\ ~term[c][s] /\ ~wit
--- END

--- FIND
    /\ UNCHANGED <<alias, rmap, published, rmapR, rmapOld, row, pend, sp, spCopy, rz, rzShards, fence, redir, sg, bound, prepped, told, dec, masked, forgotten, wit, late, wDone, reacted, ackOn>>
--- REPLACE
\* MUTATION: the split does not carry the witness to the sibling.
    /\ wit' = FALSE
    /\ UNCHANGED <<alias, rmap, published, rmapR, rmapOld, row, pend, sp, spCopy, rz, rzShards, fence, redir, sg, bound, prepped, told, dec, masked, forgotten, late, wDone, reacted, ackOn>>
--- END